{"ratings":[{"id":"C1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"normal","reason":"The normal confined full-suite gate skips unrelated tests, preventing valid evidence from resolving the verification failure and leaving the run needing human intervention."},{"id":"C2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Candidate-controlled test output can forge coverage and cause the factory to accept a criterion whose required test never ran."},{"id":"C3","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Bun can match a different test file by substring, causing the factory to accept a criterion even though the requested file did not run."}]}